@host = http://localhost:5249

### 1. Happy Path (200 OK)
POST {{host}}/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drink": "latte"
}

### 2. Помилка валідації через Endpoint Filter (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drink": "matcha"
}

### 3. Кастомний IExceptionHandler (503 Service Unavailable)
POST {{host}}/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drink": "espresso"
}

### 4. Стандартний виняток через AddProblemDetails (504 Gateway Timeout)
POST {{host}}/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "drink": "cappuccino"
}